title: "Helm — a macOS toolkit of fifteen native tools"
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source macOS toolkit: fifteen native tools in one window, including a storage cleaner with a treemap explorer, a duplicate finder, system monitors with 24-hour history and a clipboard manager.
